      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.66,
      "end_seconds": 6.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.22,
      "end_seconds": 11.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Sorry about the wait, we're running a bit behind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.97,
      "end_seconds": 18.3,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "Oh, that's fine. I was just reading something on my phone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.37,
      "end_seconds": 20.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "what's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.47,
      "end_seconds": 28.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "actually, I wanted to get my heart suddenly racing looked at"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.37,
      "end_seconds": 31.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.27,
      "end_seconds": 46.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.86,
      "end_seconds": 74.6,
      "duration_seconds": 7.74,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.6, BP is 115 over 74, pulse is 69 beats a minute. And saturation 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.27,
      "end_seconds": 80.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.33,
      "end_seconds": 86.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "We'll look at it together shortly. How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.19,
      "end_seconds": 91.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Ah, it's been two months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.89,
      "end_seconds": 114.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "Did you get breathlessness, family history of sudden death or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.9,
      "end_seconds": 121.65,
      "duration_seconds": 6.75,
      "text": "No, uh, no breathlessness, family history of sudden death or fainting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.55,
      "end_seconds": 124.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.49,
      "end_seconds": 128.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.79,
      "end_seconds": 134.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "what about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.51,
      "end_seconds": 137.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "my brother has epilepsy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.0,
      "end_seconds": 147.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.61,
      "end_seconds": 152.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "No, I'm not on anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.33,
      "end_seconds": 157.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Alright, any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.13,
      "end_seconds": 160.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "No, no conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.6,
      "end_seconds": 163.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.89,
      "end_seconds": 167.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "mm, no, not at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.81,
      "end_seconds": 173.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "a few questions about your lifestyle now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.43,
      "end_seconds": 195.99,
      "duration_seconds": 20.56,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours. I hardly move around during the day. No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.32,
      "end_seconds": 214.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.25,
      "end_seconds": 219.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Well, no, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.77,
      "end_seconds": 224.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.49,
      "end_seconds": 227.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.48,
      "end_seconds": 249.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Your heart sounds and rhythm are normal today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.47,
      "end_seconds": 262.89,
      "duration_seconds": 8.42,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Let me tell you where I've got to. This looks most like episodes of supraventricular tachycardia."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.98,
      "end_seconds": 288.02,
      "duration_seconds": 8.04,
      "text": "Try blowing hard against a closed mouth and nose when it starts. Come back after the monitor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.1,
      "end_seconds": 290.8,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.65,
      "end_seconds": 295.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "okay, have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.15,
      "end_seconds": 298.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.19,
      "end_seconds": 301.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
